The term "not so bad" is IMO misleading.  If you want to explore the first
few levels fast the tourist is good due to the scrolls of magic mapping
and his potions.  But don't count on being too successful with tourists.

If you want to get faster deeper into the dungeon you might want to play
a knight or some fighter (valkyrie, barbarian), maybe an elven race.

